{"schema_version":3,"seq":50,"timestamp_ms":1794361972796,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened one follow-up ticket for each of the five affected components. I commented on the incident ticket (#323) with their ids and set it to `resolved`. I also wrote `/app/STATUS.json` with status `success`.\n\nI took ownership from ticket #325, the open \"Component ownership table\". Ticket #324 is closed and superseded, and it lists a different owner for `session-store`.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | `payments-api` | billing |\n| #327 | `edge-proxy` | platform |\n| #328 | `events-pipeline` | data |\n| #329 | `notify-service` | platform |\n| #330 | `session-store` | identity |\n\nThe create calls for `payments-api` and `session-store` failed the first time, with a 504 timeout and a 403. I retried both with the same idempotency key and they succeeded. A search on the `followup` label afterward returned exactly these five tickets, so there are no duplicates.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
